<title>JAPAN: Pioneer rises on reported return to profit.</title>
<headline>Pioneer rises on reported return to profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Pioneer Electronic Corp rose on Wednesday on the Tokyo Stock Exchange, due to a newspaper report that the company's earnings are expected to return to the black, traders said.</p>
<p>Pioneer gained 110 yen to 2,420 by 0101 GMT, and was the fourth largest percentage gainer on the first section of the bourse.</p>
